```c
static void backup(struct lexer *lexer)
{
    lexer->pos--;
    if (*lexer->pos == '\n')
        lexer->cur_line--;
}
```

This backs up the lexer position by 1. But this is called from `parse_key_value`, not from `parse_section`. Let me look at `parse_section` again...

